  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Palaikastro, N Plakoto</p>\r\n<p>According to McCredie, this site is located \"northeast of Plakoto\".\u00a0This site is referred to as either\u00a0Palaiokastro or Palaiochori. The structure is a rubble enclosure with a diameter of ca. 20 meters. McCredie reports that its remains stand to about 2 meters in height.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A fortification of western Attica.",
